<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Commonwealth Aluminum cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Commonwealth Aluminum cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Wednesday analyst Wayne Atwell had cut his rating for Commonwealth Aluminum Corp to neutral from outperform based on price.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Louisville, Ky., company closed on Tuesday at 19-7/8.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
